		)
		(uuid "049abdb9-8603-4fe7-8772-a666bf6ebbcf")
	)
	(text "AMBIENT SENSOR: TMP117, I2C 0x48 (ADD0=GND)"
		(at 440 236 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c926450-9a3b-4c20-a326-139e8ee26426")
	)
	(text "Sensor is on the board underside in the vented well"
		(at 440 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2892327c-5ab2-42ce-b4ff-65bcf37c49a5")
	)
	(text "PROBE INPUTS 1..4 (J2..J5, TIP1..TIP4 -> AIN0..AIN3): 47k 0.1% bias to VREF_PROBE, 1k series, 100nF to GND"
		(at 20 212 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "410c9309-2a9b-426b-9671-f6bc8340f9b3")
	)
	(text "Pins 1,2,3,7 are NC per datasheet"
		(at 500 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4c9cf3c3-c0db-4992-9841-7966ec6120d3")
	)
	(text "J6 FAN (Molex KK 254 22-23-2041, 4-pin PWM fan plug)\n1 GND (black)   2 +V = VFAN (yellow/red)\n3 TACH (green) -> FAN_TACH_J -> 1k -> FAN_TACH\n4 PWM (blue) <- FAN_PWM_J <- 100R <- FAN_PWM\nNo pull-down on FAN_PWM: floating = full speed (fail-safe); fan power gated by FAN_EN.\nFAN_TACH 10k pull-up to 3V3 is in the MCU block.\nHand-soldered; not in the JLC BOM/assembly."
		(at 232.41 255.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "879a8f2a-5935-425c-8113-be450df14f62")
	)
	(text "USB-C INPUT / ESD (top-left)   PROTECTION (top-mid)   3.3 V BUCK (top-right)   ANALOG LDO (bottom-left)   LOAD SWITCHES (bottom-mid/right)"
		(at 20 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "97c9f0bb-c5d1-4626-b602-cb00458f2222")
	)
	(text "(docs/mech.md), isolated from copper pours"
		(at 440 243.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9b0c159c-5fb6-4a78-beb1-ed70719265df")
	)
	(text "PROBE ADC: ADS122C04 24-bit I2C delta-sigma, address 0x40 (A0=A1=GND), AVDD from 3V3A"
		(at 455 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4515147-a57d-4a06-8c13-270df152dc67")
	)
	(text "PJ-242 pad map from datasheet: 6 = tip, 7 = tip NC switch (to GND: empty jack reads as a hard short = unplugged), 2/3/4 = sleeve/ring (GND), 5 = ring switch (unused)"
		(at 20 217 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b10c0e4d-0bfd-4deb-bed5-b108aa071bee")
	)
	(text "U1 ESP32-C6-WROOM-1-N8 pin plan (signal | GPIO | why)\nCC1, CC2 | IO0, IO1 | CC voltage sense (ADC1_CH0/1), 1 nF filters\nADC_DRDY | IO2 | probe ADC data-ready, 10k pull-up (ADC1_CH2)\nLOAD_FAULT | IO3 | load switch fault flags (pull-up R7 on power block)\nUSB_DN, USB_DP | IO12, IO13 | native USB Serial/JTAG\nLED | IO10 | status LED D2 via 680R\nBTN | IO9 | button SW1 to GND (also boot-strap pin: held low at reset = download mode)\nFAN_EN | IO11 | fan load switch enable\nFAN_PWM, FAN_TACH | IO18, IO19 | fan drive, open-collector tach with 10k pull-up\nSERVO_PWM, SERVO_EN | IO20, IO21 | servo signal, servo load switch enable\nI2C_SDA, I2C_SCL | IO22, IO23 | I2C bus (ATECC608B, ADC), 4.7k pull-ups here\nUART_TX, UART_RX | TXD0 (IO16), RXD0 (IO17) | bring-up console on test pads\nEN | EN | 10k pull-up + 1uF reset RC, TP_EN\nSpare, no-connect | IO4 IO5 IO6 IO7 IO8 IO15 | IO4/5 strapping on module, IO8/IO15 strapping (no resistors)"
		(at 205.74 378.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b1da903e-7b06-4021-8892-18965afe534e")
	)
	(text "SECURE ELEMENT: ATECC608B, I2C 0x60; bus at 100 kHz for the wake pulse"
		(at 500 236 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7c162bf-38d2-461e-82cd-eee458d09fb6")
	)
	(text "J7 SERVO (Molex KK 254 22-23-2031, Hitec plug)\n1 GND (black)   2 +V = VSERVO (red)\n3 SIGNAL (yellow) = SERVO_SIG_J <- 330R <- SERVO_PWM\n10k pull-down on SERVO_SIG_J; 100uF reservoir rides servo start current.\nHand-soldered; not in the JLC BOM/assembly."
		(at 330.2 255.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd36e4f8-df59-4049-96af-c5b73b62c5a1")
	)
	(text "POWER TREE\nVBUS (5 V, 1.1 A PTC F1) -> TLV62569 buck: 3V3, 2 A for MCU\nVBUS_F -> ferrite FB1 -> TLV75533 LDO: 3V3A for ADC\nVBUS_F -> 2x TPS2553: VSERVO (0.6 A), VFAN (0.52 A)\nNOTE: SMF5.0A clamps ~9.2 V peak but TLV62569 abs max is 6 V;\nthe PTC and 100uF bulk absorb surge energy. Accepted risk."
		(at 150 125 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c0813d11-d59f-4361-9642-af554fdd0be8")
	)
	(text "VREF_PROBE rail: 3V3A - ferrite - 10R - 10uF + 100nF; feeds only the four 47k bias resistors and REFP"
		(at 455 104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f051c035-a4dc-4007-95b8-a37347dc9989")
	)
	(text "U4 TLV62569: the 3V3 digital rail. 2 A synchronous buck, 1.5 MHz, from VBUS_F (5 V).\nVout = 0.6 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 3.32 V; C7 feed-forward; EN tied to VIN (always on).\nLoads: ESP32-C6 (Wi-Fi TX bursts), U8 DVDD, U10, U11, pull-ups.\nIn: C4 10 uF + C14 100 nF at VIN/GND. Out: C5, C6 10 uF. Layout per SLVSDG1C fig. 20."
		(at 297 84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "174c6226-9fdc-40ee-8aae-313da535a6de")
	)
	(text "U5 TLV75533P: the 3V3A analog rail. 500 mA LDO from VBUS_F through FB1 (VBUS_LDO),\nkept apart from the buck's ripple. Feeds U8 AVDD and, through FB2 + R18, VREF_PROBE.\nIn: C8 1 uF. Out: C9 1 uF + C15 100 nF. EN tied to IN."
		(at 35 192 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "deb8bc43-9b4e-4077-94c9-ff54d4e89e4e")
	)
	(text "U6, U7 TPS2553: current-limited power switches from VBUS_F.\nU6 -> VSERVO (damper servo, J7), limit by R5; U7 -> VFAN (blower, J6), limit by R6.\nEN from the MCU, 100k pull-downs (R8, R9) keep both off through boot.\nOpen-drain FAULT shared on LOAD_FAULT (R7). In: C16/C17 100 nF; out: 10 uF + 100 nF."
		(at 170 192 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04a06c9d-af66-4667-9d62-f260cefe5a94")
	)
	(text "U2, U3 USBLC6-2SC6: ESD clamps at the USB-C (pins 1/6 and 3/4 are\nthe same I/O inside the part). J1 side on 6/4, MCU side on 1/3, so the\npair runs J1 -> U2 -> ESP32-C6 straight through (flow-through, 90 ohm).\nU2: USB 2.0 pair. U3: CC1/CC2 (Rd 5.1k R1, R2 on the J1 side;\nC19/C20 1 nF at the MCU ADC pins). Pin 5 to VBUS_RAW with\nC38 100 nF at the pins (ST fig. 17)."
		(at 120 72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "437233fc-2148-4d70-b99f-0cfb8eed2998")
	)
	(text "Probe ESD: TPD4E05U06DQAR on the jack side of the series resistors. Straight-through routing (datasheet fig. 7-11): each tip runs across the part over its I/O pad and the NC pad opposite (1/10 TIP1, 2/9 TIP2, 4/7 TIP3, 5/6 TIP4; NC pins are not connected inside)"
		(at 95 272 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "493b05aa-7f52-4c69-a76e-7e42d5076a1d")
	)
